WEBVTT

00:35.540 --> 00:38.250
How's it been, Moloch-san?

00:38.250 --> 00:40.150
Gotten any sweet deals?

00:43.550 --> 00:44.220
This.

00:44.630 --> 00:47.170
What's the trinket?

00:47.170 --> 00:50.220
It was commissioned by Marie Antoinette.

00:50.220 --> 00:53.910
Apparently, it brings great misfortune to its owner.

00:53.910 --> 01:00.100
I got it as a sacrifice for murdering the President of Mormossoi.

01:00.100 --> 01:02.200
Jealous?

01:02.740 --> 01:04.520
President of <i>where</i>? Never heard of it.

01:04.520 --> 01:06.450
Must've been a shitty job.

01:07.340 --> 01:11.590
In order to summon a demon, a sacrifice must be offered.

01:11.590 --> 01:16.410
Additionally, the offering must be something that the summoner cares greatly for.

01:17.190 --> 01:18.420
Shit!

01:18.420 --> 01:20.280
That's one hell of a sacrifice!

01:20.280 --> 01:23.340
All I'm getting is a pig's foot or a leg of Char's Zaku...

01:23.340 --> 01:27.340
Could those really be that important to Akutabe?!

01:27.340 --> 01:30.380
You're full of shit, narrator!

01:30.910 --> 01:33.360
And how about you, Azazel?

01:33.850 --> 01:38.220
Still getting screwed over by Akutabe?

01:38.220 --> 01:39.430
Shut up.

01:39.960 --> 01:41.920
But you don't have much of a choice.

01:41.920 --> 01:44.650
All you can do is incite lust.

01:44.650 --> 01:47.330
You're only good at making people horny.

01:48.190 --> 01:49.610
I SAID SHUT UP!

01:50.670 --> 01:54.440
If you don't like him, just get rid of that loser.

01:54.440 --> 01:56.950
That's what I'd do.

01:57.530 --> 01:58.970
I know.

01:59.530 --> 02:02.360
I've been thinking about it for a while.

02:03.170 --> 02:04.410
Just watch.

02:06.070 --> 02:08.870
So what if he can incite violence?

02:08.870 --> 02:12.650
You can't just muscle your way through all of your problems!

02:12.650 --> 02:14.250
The meat-head.

02:16.810 --> 02:18.000
Oh, I'm being summoned.

02:18.500 --> 02:20.010
I'll be back.

02:26.150 --> 02:27.250
Wow, he's actually here!

02:27.250 --> 02:29.720
No shit, Sherlock! You summoned me!

02:29.720 --> 02:32.020
Anyway, <i>you</i> summoned me?

02:32.020 --> 02:33.440
I-I did!

02:33.440 --> 02:34.690
I'm pretty awesome, aren't I?

02:35.250 --> 02:37.640
I'm your contractor this time.

02:37.640 --> 02:41.150
Akutabe-san told me that I need to learn how to summon demons on my own.

02:41.530 --> 02:42.440
I see...

02:42.440 --> 02:43.410
So you've been hitting the books?

02:43.410 --> 02:45.210
Good for you!

02:46.320 --> 02:48.050
This is the real world.

02:48.050 --> 02:51.670
Four-eyes here is working for Akutabe-han, and she's my contractor.

02:51.670 --> 02:54.120
Things couldn't be worse.

02:54.970 --> 02:57.570
So, what's the job?

02:58.070 --> 02:59.320
Job?

02:59.320 --> 03:01.320
Oh! There isn't one.

03:01.320 --> 03:03.040
I was just practicing my summoning.

03:04.130 --> 03:05.590
Practicing, you say?!

03:05.860 --> 03:06.780
Yep!

03:06.780 --> 03:09.310
Thanks a lot for coming over. I'm sure you're busy.

03:09.310 --> 03:11.180
You can go back now, if you want.

03:11.640 --> 03:13.230
Are you messing with me?!

03:13.230 --> 03:15.470
Should I hit you or something? You idiot!

03:15.470 --> 03:16.540
I'm not messing with you!

03:16.540 --> 03:19.040
I'm just practicing summoning!

03:19.040 --> 03:23.640
No no no! Hold on a second! Summoning a demon for practice <i>is</i> messing with them!{ You're treating me like an idiot! - with this it'd be too long}

03:24.200 --> 03:26.040
If you're dealing with demons,

03:26.040 --> 03:28.480
you've got to take it seriously!

03:29.200 --> 03:34.110
Sure, I'm nice. But there are some really fucked up demons out there!

03:34.350 --> 03:36.380
Fine, fine. I get it.

03:36.380 --> 03:38.570
Take me seriously, you bitch!

03:36.380 --> 03:38.570
Okay, then your job for today is to help tidy the place up.

03:39.480 --> 03:42.030
When you're done, you can clean the upstairs windows, too.

03:43.410 --> 03:44.380
All right!

03:44.380 --> 03:48.000
I should summon Beelzebub-san to help Azazel-san with the cleaning, as well!

03:48.660 --> 03:51.160
B... Be... Bee... Beelzebub...

03:51.370 --> 03:52.650
Here we go, found it!

03:52.650 --> 03:55.960
This is awesome. I've gotten pretty fluent in this alphabet.

03:56.530 --> 04:00.920
Remove Azazel-san's summoning circle, and put Beelzebub-san's in its place...

04:00.920 --> 04:04.930
Careful with the runes... Even one mistake could spell disaster.

04:05.930 --> 04:07.120
Perfect!

04:07.120 --> 04:09.140
Now, for the incantation.

04:27.990 --> 04:28.410
Huh?

04:29.710 --> 04:32.110
They're different...

04:32.960 --> 04:37.760
Shit! Instead of Beelzebub's Bakuro,

04:37.760 --> 04:40.830
I've summoned Moloch's Violence!

04:47.880 --> 04:50.750
Tell me! What is your desire?

04:51.650 --> 04:55.860
I have the power to grant it to you, weakling!

04:58.550 --> 04:59.790
Wha?! I'm tiny!

04:59.790 --> 05:00.770
I'm puny!

05:01.320 --> 05:02.730
Huh? Moloch-san?

05:03.330 --> 05:04.480
Azazel-kun?

05:04.480 --> 05:06.010
What the hell is wrong with me?

05:06.010 --> 05:08.010
It's Akutabe's doing.

05:08.010 --> 05:11.960
He's set up a barrier around this building.

05:11.960 --> 05:13.600
It weakens our powers.

05:13.600 --> 05:18.570
Once you've been summoned, you're stuck in this cutesy body until you leave the human world!

05:19.360 --> 05:22.100
I'm so fucking soft and cute!

05:22.100 --> 05:26.080
I'm supposed to be really cool! And really scary! {Check timing}

05:25.710 --> 05:27.080
Enough of your shenanigans! {Check timing}

05:29.230 --> 05:30.830
You didn't have to punch me! {Untimed line}

05:31.030 --> 05:35.670
We just need to kill Akutabe and be done with it! {Untimed line}

05:36.160 --> 05:38.240
But first, little girl...

05:38.240 --> 05:38.590
Yes?

05:40.240 --> 05:41.000
Give me my sacrifice!

05:40.730 --> 05:41.890
Ouch! Ow!

05:41.540 --> 05:43.370
Give me it, right now!

05:41.890 --> 05:43.370
Fine! Okay!

05:44.180 --> 05:47.570
I made if for Beelzebub, but I guess it's yours now.

05:53.830 --> 05:55.900
You really have great taste in curry,

05:55.900 --> 05:58.360
even if you don't have any in men.

06:01.300 --> 06:03.240
Don't flip out, Moloch-san!

06:03.940 --> 06:07.320
You dare to summon me, and offer such a worthless sacrifice?!

06:07.720 --> 06:11.330
You had better be prepared to suffer for this!

06:17.400 --> 06:21.060
Moloch-san had a farm, E-I-E-I-O!

06:21.060 --> 06:24.960
On that farm he had a cow named Saku-chan, E-I-E-I-O!

06:24.960 --> 06:27.200
With a moo-moo here, and moo-moo there!

06:27.200 --> 06:29.410
Here a moo, there a moo, everywhere a moo-moo!

06:29.410 --> 06:33.050
Moloch-san had a farm, E-I-E-I-O!

06:33.050 --> 06:34.970
On that farm he had a cow named Saku-chan,

06:33.560 --> 06:35.210
I'm sorry!

06:35.210 --> 06:36.470
E-I-E-I-O!

06:36.640 --> 06:37.100
Hey!

06:38.260 --> 06:41.670
It wasn't me! Saku-chan did it on her own!

06:41.670 --> 06:44.280
And actually, Moloch-san here was picky about her sacrifice.

06:44.280 --> 06:47.270
He said something about the curry being worthless and such!

06:50.830 --> 06:52.250
Eat it.

06:52.250 --> 06:52.690
What?

06:53.960 --> 06:55.230
Eat it.

06:55.230 --> 06:56.650
Or I'll kill you.

06:56.970 --> 06:58.370
What is this murderous,

06:58.370 --> 07:03.500
overwhelming aura that threatens to erase my demonic existence from the universe?!

07:03.500 --> 07:04.320
He's like Akiko...

07:04.780 --> 07:08.620
He's just like Akiko Wada of the demon world!{lolwut}{scene bleed}

07:10.200 --> 07:11.580
Thanks for the food!{Brine: Personally, I don't even think this line needs to be translated.}

07:16.280 --> 07:17.410
I'm back to normal!

07:17.410 --> 07:20.630
I'm so glad he's eating my sacrifice, after all!

07:23.650 --> 07:24.560
This taste...

07:25.390 --> 07:28.010
Oh, that's beef curry, by the way.

07:28.010 --> 07:30.770
Um, I hope you like it!

07:31.350 --> 07:32.580
Cannibal!

07:32.580 --> 07:33.560
You shouldn't laugh!

07:34.130 --> 07:35.060
Quickly. Eat.

07:40.100 --> 07:41.210
Let's go home.

07:42.330 --> 07:44.120
Let's go home for the day.

07:45.460 --> 07:46.260
Okay...

07:47.080 --> 07:48.500
I'm sorry...

07:48.500 --> 07:49.950
Why are you crying, anyway?

07:50.290 --> 07:51.250
It'll be okay.

07:51.250 --> 07:53.100
It'll all be okay.

07:55.540 --> 07:57.730
You're lucky I was around.

07:58.370 --> 08:01.920
You were almost irreversibly transformed.

08:02.930 --> 08:07.380
Be more careful the next time you use a grimoire.

08:08.590 --> 08:09.920
I'm sorry...

08:11.430 --> 08:13.420
Come on.

08:13.420 --> 08:15.620
It's okay for demons to feel down, too.

08:15.620 --> 08:19.010
Come on, we're living creatures, too.

08:19.010 --> 08:22.430
Oh, I'm saying "Come on" a lot, aren't I?

08:22.830 --> 08:26.090
This may sound a bit apologetic, but it's okay.

08:26.090 --> 08:27.900
I'm just making this up as I go.
